            <div xml:id="m-29283777-9856-45ee-af23-fac4997f5ed8">
              <lg xml:id="m-f846daca-045b-49a6-91db-70ec968815b4">
                <l xml:id="m-87659671-50be-4706-948d-d219a4401b9b" facs="#m-22af31bb-b7f7-4ad1-b335-8694722be845" label="ambiguous">Corpus Christi.</l><l xml:id="m-9362b76a-fd5f-4c50-9cb4-6ff7a5eafaf4" facs="#m-4e8c25cd-3b9f-4b38-aa66-a17d629f8561" label="ambiguous">026</l><l xml:id="m-5fa17597-b8d6-4ae7-b740-88ff714db62c" facs="#m-9710f0c9-7e2b-4062-b44a-23f3abf010ab" label="lyrics-like">domos non habétis ad manducán- Laudo vos? In hoc non laudo. Tu</l><l xml:id="m-e9d29705-cb29-4e0f-a399-9b780ba0c878" facs="#m-f7bc0c9d-be7a-4065-ab15-a162513d08a9" label="lyrics-like">autem Dómine, miserére nobis.</l><l xml:id="m-b9beece5-1b67-4a96-a376-de3fc5042a9d" facs="#m-df6a9389-2e4f-470a-8bc5-933b5493c8bc" label="lyrics-like">dum et bibéndum? aut Ecclésiam</l><l xml:id="m-f830af76-61cd-4742-8f50-026cd376759e" facs="#m-36b45359-081f-4a6b-bb70-cce2632e9979" label="lyrics-like">R. Deo grátias.</l><l xml:id="m-f99a79d7-f9d3-43ec-8ebe-fbf499aea5a7" facs="#m-ac83435b-4d0e-408a-b47e-9d867d987b16" label="lyrics-like">Dei contémnitis, et confúnditis eos,</l><l xml:id="m-44118a49-a6b7-4161-8dc9-2b3ffaa07f23" facs="#m-ddf85c8e-9f93-46d3-b3a3-3a5157807b06" label="ambiguous">qui non habent? Quid dicam vobis?</l><l xml:id="m-a81a38a8-baf0-467b-83cc-b538b506ce8b" facs="#m-c44fd328-fd6b-4f57-a4f8-1f8a3bf9aa63" label="ambiguous">Resp.1.E</l><l xml:id="m-bcd751ad-22fc-4c86-b529-531afbd1b765" facs="#m-6a48dbbb-49f6-4a64-aeee-2515479a6bd4" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-50b3bf75-3c9c-4c16-9729-b67ce6de1f41" facs="#m-b49807dd-70c7-4f6e-8269-f55abbd8c4b7" label="lyrics-like">Mmo-lábit haé- dum“ multi-túdo fi- li-6́-rum</l><l xml:id="m-2a3ff974-a4bc-42d7-897a-18cae8bfdf56" facs="#m-922d77bf-fd77-4223-8628-939dd970ff03" label="lyrics-like">vé- spe-ram Páschae:"Et é¬</l><l xml:id="m-b0af6a68-5778-4c03-9bbb-042d9f61fc0f" facs="#m-3d2a5555-072d-47fb-836f-5ff59b500774" label="ambiguous">el ad</l><l xml:id="m-923bc803-f8a2-4691-ad87-49e4ff930f91" facs="#m-1938dd97-9bdc-4b29-84a8-26554ac3373c" label="ambiguous">Isra¬</l><l xml:id="m-9f9b34f6-d861-4d63-9007-d851fc3eabbf" facs="#m-84f51b6f-07d4-45eb-88d2-4d24311bedaa" label="lyrics-like">pá- nes. V. Pá¬</l><l xml:id="m-74c74f74-e5a1-4946-8a60-621105afb918" facs="#m-c1af45ff-821d-4a1d-8438-3da0ea339d24" label="lyrics-like">dent cárnes,</l><l xml:id="m-9e1cb4b0-238c-4f48-b0ce-aab920ef57f5" facs="#m-d30a6f79-deb5-4dc4-8841-15e15d4924dc" label="lyrics-like">et á-zy- mos</l><l xml:id="m-af7b0c88-7284-4d9d-898a-cc7d61070f00" facs="#m-82beb0cb-0189-4e88-b680-d07f5d73ed91" label="lyrics-like">tus est Chrí-stus: i</l><l xml:id="m-6ef999c1-6367-4f64-9bb8-d1fe58703236" facs="#m-ab57bb63-3a62-43be-a317-1172bd199817" label="ambiguous">scha</l><l xml:id="m-7df64bc8-75c8-4318-92cf-dbfea9aa9d16" facs="#m-126849a5-c14d-4b96-8ba4-24f1e76f1138" label="lyrics-like">nóstrum immo-lá¬</l><l xml:id="m-8cc56a5a-bdc1-4e69-b4db-665b0f048ab5" facs="#m-9aae20a6-5510-4cb6-923b-dbfca8285444" label="lyrics-like">taque e- pu-lé-mur in ázymis since-ri-tá- tis et</l><l xml:id="m-40f7f247-83a5-4914-8b22-49617f99c378" facs="#m-fedcc632-8181-4a9d-b984-c5893b06948e" label="lyrics-like">ve-ri-tá-tis."Et.</l><l xml:id="m-0eabcbb4-ff38-44b1-a4b6-8481ea8c62a9" facs="#m-c1572c6a-2af6-4cd2-87ca-448cd95be207" label="lyrics-like">The Lector: Júbe, dómne, benedicere.</l><l xml:id="m-96a09ebe-7602-4d33-bc2d-7f62439bfe74" facs="#m-d79d67ac-cd8d-42e6-96e8-8023e7d90750" label="lyrics-like">Blessing: Unigénitus Déi Filius * nos benedícere et adiuváre</l><l xml:id="m-84039ac1-833a-4476-aeb9-857ab190448a" facs="#m-565d1af8-bdcb-4acd-aac1-1c9e096942cf" label="lyrics-like">dignétur.</l><l xml:id="m-78ea0cd8-902b-4359-a999-10c560c72031" facs="#m-3943fcbf-b435-4444-ac18-c667539fa2ca" label="ambiguous">Lesson II.</l><l xml:id="m-4888e051-e3f6-476f-9e54-f478436297b9" facs="#m-d21edfa7-3b04-4bb0-ab0f-b17aae2b0bf4" label="lyrics-like">vGo enim accépi a Dómino quod liter et cálicem, postquam coenávit,</l><l xml:id="m-13e54f49-2fc9-44c9-9b2e-a5eb82f95fd3" facs="#m-126ff752-d0f8-4536-a07f-e8280086adf8" label="lyrics-like">C et trádidi vobis, quóniam Dó¬ dicens : Hic calix novum testamén¬</l><l xml:id="m-ed2ffca4-3dbe-4668-9304-3eecd28da35a" facs="#m-1d865ebf-7527-416a-83a0-d097f0d886ac" label="ambiguous">minus Jesus, in qua nocte trade¬</l><l xml:id="m-7a4ec5c2-d0b1-4956-9898-57832d4f28c2" facs="#m-8a769eca-67e5-4dfd-a18b-0ec2c1edca84" label="lyrics-like">tum est in meo sánguine: hoc fáci¬</l><l xml:id="m-a07b190c-5847-4dd3-ad0b-686b27647aee" facs="#m-a4a5d4a1-9461-44ae-98c9-c330ea791858" label="lyrics-like">te, quotiescúmque bibétis, in meam</l><l xml:id="m-6bb34a19-3aa3-410e-98d8-7085a1d86fb4" facs="#m-063ae516-d743-4f50-97e2-c85542f04e75" label="lyrics-like">bátur, accépit panem, et grátias</l><l xml:id="m-7bf30695-cf4f-4772-8caa-ab18714b104b" facs="#m-d7ff2555-2c58-4986-a05a-1cfd6cd79ad5" label="lyrics-like">commemoratiónem. Quotiescúm¬</l><l xml:id="m-787a8bba-f19d-4e07-9c35-4bd7dc77a0fc" facs="#m-723def18-cb14-4f2d-b062-8db6d44f06a6" label="lyrics-like">agens fregit, et dixit : Accípite, et</l><l xml:id="m-d0c3cccd-4cb8-44dc-8ae6-0fa082b5ab52" facs="#m-68cafe3f-910a-4394-95cc-1d04e3a6c459" label="lyrics-like">que enim manducábitis panem</l><l xml:id="m-935e4d20-e840-4eaf-b8f5-7e1713756d0e" facs="#m-44d131ff-bea4-432e-8ba7-ed05f66d44fa" label="lyrics-like">manducáte: hoc est corpus meum,</l><l xml:id="m-82006870-4560-4239-b129-dd2a146f41c3" facs="#m-8e04e1e7-217b-4640-9984-8086b62d5129" label="lyrics-like">hunc, et cálicem bibétis, mortem</l><l xml:id="m-b3ff96ce-e29b-4194-a822-02b51f8fa2e3" facs="#m-11287197-472a-4295-a3c5-94b4a066be2d" label="lyrics-like">quod pro vobis tradétur : hoc fácite</l><l xml:id="m-cc565f4a-0e48-43e6-a2d4-174346a3dd07" facs="#m-e4edb5ab-0c59-4b07-865a-bd98c5dbea76" label="lyrics-like">in meam commemoratiónem. Simi-l Dómini annuntiábitis, donec véniat.</l></lg>
